{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758490/extras/71af5610c39e99321cbf416837a2fada.poster.avif?t=1773173013\" width=281 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758490/extras/71af5610c39e99321cbf416837a2fada.webm?t=1773173013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sugar Squad Rumble is a fun, easy to play roguelike turn-based RPG in a food focused game world that offers lots of depth for those that want to go down the radish hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle the food gangs of New York to rescue Don Cheesecake!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the streets of New York as the Sugar Squad - four sugary sweets ready to throw down with every food gang in the city. Your mission is to track down Don Cheesecake - the Sugar Squad kingpin. Battle through rounds to earn XP, loot and clues to the Don's location. To help you, recruit rats to dumpster-dive for treasure and stock up on shady and limited items from the Trenchcoat Rat. Can you beat every food gang all the way to Don Cheesecake?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sugar Rush System \u2013 raise your sugar levels as you battle opponents and charge up your team to unleash massive damage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute hand-drawn kawaii art style with big eyes that hypnotize you with their cuteness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat pits you against pitted fruit and other monstrosities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laughs around every corner.\u00a0 Hilarious dialog throughout the story, and characters taunt each other during battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-class system with upgradable abilities to increase your team\u2019s effectiveness.\u00a0 Try different combinations to best suit your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rest and recover your teammates, no perma-death!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet all sorts of rats. Lots of rats. Pizza rat, taco rat, etc. You can pay them to dumpster dive for treasure or they can help you on your quest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various dance moves for your to use in your victory celebrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect trinkets and snacks to help you in your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758490/extras/b8e6788a63e36696044b931a03da27a4.poster.avif?t=1773173013\" width=328 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758490/extras/b8e6788a63e36696044b931a03da27a4.webm?t=1773173013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758490?t=1773173013","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758490?t=1773173013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758490/99cf8e068c5728149f01aad549c658a259489141/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773173013","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758490/99cf8e068c5728149f01aad549c658a259489141/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773173013","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"conte